{{mi-adj}}

# [[sour]]

===Noun===
{{mi-noun}}

# {{non-gloss definition|a ceremony to remove {{l|mi|tapu}} from a new house or canoe}}
# {{non-gloss definition|{{l|mi|karakia|t=ritual chants}} and customs for the opening of new houses, canoes and other events}}
# [[marae]] [[protocol]] - {{non-gloss definition|customs of the marae and {{l|mi|wharenui}}, particularly those related to formal activities such as {{l|mi|pōhiri}}, speeches and {{l|mi|mihimihi}}}}
# [[acid]]
# [[bitterness]]
# {{lb|mi|obsolete}} [[kava]], plant brought by ancestors from the South Pacific, {{taxlink|Piper methysticum|species}}.

